  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the beef roast with salt and paprika.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Sear the beef roast until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the cooking wine, garlic, and onion to the tagine pot.",
    "Cover the tagine pot and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Roast for 2 hours or until the beef is tender.",
    "Sprinkle the cashews over the beef roast and return to the oven for an additional 10 minutes."
